WEBVTT

00:20:57.799 --> 00:21:00.577
to give people social-credit scores

00:21:00.601 --> 00:21:03.966
that can be used in all kinds of ways.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.164
On the face of it,

00:21:05.188 --> 00:21:07.918
you could imagine lots of cases
where people who otherwise

00:21:07.942 --> 00:21:13.426
had no access to say, a government job
or other opportunities,

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:16.212
would, because they've built up
a good social-credit score.

00:21:16.236 --> 00:21:17.537
And then on the other hand,

00:21:17.561 --> 00:21:21.855
you can imagine all kinds
of creepier forms of government control.

00:21:21.879 --> 00:21:23.356
Ultimately, it feels like

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:27.322
this is the ultimate case
of Big Brother watching you.

00:21:27.346 --> 00:21:31.855
What's your prediction
about how this is received